Description: Fix LLVM-16 for C++23/libc++ compatibility (remaining files)
 This patch fixes remaining C++23 compatibility issues in LLVM-16 bundled
 with SwiftShader not covered by patches 0027-0029. Includes:
 - ModuleSummaryIndex GlobalValueSummary incomplete type fixes
 - ScopedPrinter DelimitedScope out-of-line destructor
 - MIPatternMatch LLT conversion, ResourcePriorityQueue include
 - Various .get() removal and lambda parameter type changes
Author: Rafael Mendez <debian@mendez.tech>
Last-Update: 2025-11-22

